# Saaniya security + cookie protocol (Phase 1)

Full doc: `docs/ops/saaniya-security-cookie-protocol.md`

When editing any public site or Vercel deploy in this org:

1. Ensure security headers: HSTS, nosniff, X-Frame-Options DENY, Referrer-Policy, Permissions-Policy, X-XSS-Protection
2. Never ship placeholder Google Analytics (`G-XXXXXXXXXX`); gate real analytics behind consent + GPC
3. Keep / add cookie banner with essential vs analytics; honor `navigator.globalPrivacyControl`
4. Prefer Vercel Web Analytics over unconsented third-party trackers
5. Preview deployments should use Vercel Standard Deployment Protection

Do not weaken headers for convenience without documenting an exception (e.g. mic for Riyaz).
